#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Measure of the unit `web` (petshop/web): check <build-dir>.

The build dir holds web.py and the four modules. Every sentence of pages.md is a
named case below. Two layers:

  1. HTTP layer (standard library): sections "Running", "Every page", "Pages", "Changes".
  2. Browser layer (Playwright for Node, Chromium): "Rules of a professional interface",
     hard rules as cases, graded rules as a count of defects.

All hard cases pass: exit 0, last stdout line = graded defects + bytes of web.py / 1,000,000.
Any hard case fails: exit 1, the failing case names on stderr.
"""
